; Window offsets below are design-time only. On _ready() windowsHandler
; retiles the first three across the real viewport and centres the last two:
; three 560-wide columns is the arithmetic ceiling at 1080p, so Settings and
; Music float above the desktop instead of joining the row. Both are authored
; hidden -- _register() reads that as MINIMIZED and gives them an idle tile.

